sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: The product page's TCP three-way handshake
    accDescr: Every TCP message travels through IP, the link layer, and the physical layer. The initial client sequence is 1000, the server sequence is 8000.
    participant C as Computer's TCP
    participant S as Server's TCP
    Note over C,S: Every message travels through IP, link, and physical layers
    C->>S: SYN, SEQ=1000
    S->>C: SYN + ACK, SEQ=8000, ACK=1001
    C->>S: ACK, SEQ=1001, ACK=8001
    Note over C,S: TCP connection established
